            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">C002 simplified components and C004 perpendicular uplift cases remain distinct. Direct-pier loads must represent the same wind direction.</paragraph>
